cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Raspberry Pi Imager download statistics: time series 2021–2026 (rpi-os-trends)"
authors:
  - family-names: Schweizer
    given-names: Philipp
    affiliation: raspberry.tips
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/raspberry-tips/rpi-os-trends"
url: "https://raspberry.tips/en/raspberry-pi-os-statistics"
abstract: >-
  Time series of the shares of operating systems, host architectures and
  locales among downloads through the Raspberry Pi Imager, as published by
  Raspberry Pi Ltd at https://rpi-imager-stats.raspberrypi.com/ (rolling
  30-day window). Points from October 2021 to June 2026 were recovered from
  Internet Archive snapshots; since 17 August 2026 the series is collected
  weekly by a GitHub Action. Shares refer to Imager downloads, not to the installed base.
keywords:
  - Raspberry Pi
  - Raspberry Pi Imager
  - operating systems
  - download statistics
  - single-board computers
  - time series
